++| 新 categories/projects/边库 | Impl BLOCK | F-I-2 |
++| companion 打开 Side Panel | Impl BLOCK | F-I-4；已有测试锁 never openSidePanel |
++| RAG 跳过 sanitizer | Security BLOCK | Wave 0 必带 |
